      "en": "A dead job = someone must know. An n8n workflow every 15 minutes: if there are new dead jobs, send Telegram the type, the error and a «retry» link (an endpoint putting it back to queued). And review the causes weekly: the same error repeating = a bug to fix, not more retries."
